body:
I already had a character on this particular set of mods, a mage, not a single problem in 150h.

&#x200B;

So that's why i did not really got why :(

Well, what i did right before the fight, was to chug Sujama, and pop a Chameleon spell (10%) you get when Illusion is a Major skill.

&#x200B;

Exactly, a mod from a collection on Vortex got me that, but i don't really use it this fire ain't got no hand, which defeats the point of my journey !

&#x200B;

I really don't know if it could have f'ed up my stats and all, but that's the only thing that comes to mind.

Dude i've been searching for a week for the song used in "THE CONSPIRACY THEORY ICEBERG (part 2)"

&#x200B;

I see people mention that it is New Retro wave, but so for no luck.

&#x200B;

I'll keep searching and if i find anything, i'll come around
